-   position(width: Double, height: Double, x: Double, y: Double, attachments:
-   List[Caption.Attachment] = Caption.Attachment.compass, standoff: Double = 0.0, reach: Double
-   = 0.0, padding: Double = 0.0, priority: Int = 0, fallback: Caption.Fallback =
-   Caption.Fallback.Overlap)(using Arranger.Pass^): Caption.Position`, `def avoid(obstacles:
+ - Nuova libreria `cartouche`, un motore di posizionamento del testo: `def arrange[result](body:
+   (Arranger.Pass^) ?=> result)(using Arranger): result` esegue il suo corpo due volte,
+   registrando ogni chiamata `position(...)` nella prima esecuzione e rispondendole, nella
+   seconda, dalla disposizione risolta. Inoltre `def position(caption: Caption)(using
+   Arranger.Pass^): Caption.Position`, `def position(width: Double, height: Double, x: Double, y:
+   Double, attachments: List[Caption.Attachment] = Caption.Attachment.compass, standoff: Double =
+   0.0, reach: Double = 0.0, padding: Double = 0.0, priority: Int = 0, fallback: Caption.Fallback
+   = Caption.Fallback.Overlap)(using Arranger.Pass^): Caption.Position`, `def avoid(obstacles:

